    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/1a59fe76f0dd56c4bd26e6be88f27c17.webp?t=1720813438\" width=600 height=55 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/1b0f3b28ebedb5424724e4cb3f6a3174.poster.avif?t=1720813438\" width=600 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/1b0f3b28ebedb5424724e4cb3f6a3174.webm?t=1720813438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/1b0f3b28ebedb5424724e4cb3f6a3174.mp4?t=1720813438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Raid, explore and grind handcrafted dungeons by using the mysterious portal device 'Gate of Torment', searching for loot and Dungeon Keys to unlock new dungeons. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/f8853ac3eb36cb5ae7f664a896793ad1.webp?t=1720813438\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/4e4bec1c477f9b8d7e620448f95b4c9b.poster.avif?t=1720813438\" width=598 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/4e4bec1c477f9b8d7e620448f95b4c9b.webm?t=1720813438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/4e4bec1c477f9b8d7e620448f95b4c9b.mp4?t=1720813438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Slay demons and cultists by wielding firearms and black magic. Challenging and unique combat gameplay with 8-directional aiming that rewards tactical positioning and patience, but also fast reactive play when things get hot. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/6493e753ed7899be4b4eb8cacd1e750f.webp?t=1720813438\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/7aba1527ab59543824e648cbb1b6af30.poster.avif?t=1720813438\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/7aba1527ab59543824e648cbb1b6af30.webm?t=1720813438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/7aba1527ab59543824e648cbb1b6af30.mp4?t=1720813438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Extract back to your Hideout to store the loot you've found. In The Hideout you can replenish, modify your loadout and choose what dungeon to raid next. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/b3787a0716e935b94653e7552c740d88.webp?t=1720813438\" width=600 height=55 /></span><br>If you're interested in early <strong>PLAY-TESTING</strong> or otherwise want to support and follow the development, please join the Discord server! Discord link in the sidebar -&gt;",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/1a59fe76f0dd56c4bd26e6be88f27c17.webp?t=1720813438\" width=600 height=55 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/1b0f3b28ebedb5424724e4cb3f6a3174.poster.avif?t=1720813438\" width=600 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/1b0f3b28ebedb5424724e4cb3f6a3174.webm?t=1720813438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/1b0f3b28ebedb5424724e4cb3f6a3174.mp4?t=1720813438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Raid, explore and grind handcrafted dungeons by using the mysterious portal device 'Gate of Torment', searching for loot and Dungeon Keys to unlock new dungeons. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/f8853ac3eb36cb5ae7f664a896793ad1.webp?t=1720813438\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/4e4bec1c477f9b8d7e620448f95b4c9b.poster.avif?t=1720813438\" width=598 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/4e4bec1c477f9b8d7e620448f95b4c9b.webm?t=1720813438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/4e4bec1c477f9b8d7e620448f95b4c9b.mp4?t=1720813438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Slay demons and cultists by wielding firearms and black magic. Challenging and unique combat gameplay with 8-directional aiming that rewards tactical positioning and patience, but also fast reactive play when things get hot. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/6493e753ed7899be4b4eb8cacd1e750f.webp?t=1720813438\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/7aba1527ab59543824e648cbb1b6af30.poster.avif?t=1720813438\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/7aba1527ab59543824e648cbb1b6af30.webm?t=1720813438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/7aba1527ab59543824e648cbb1b6af30.mp4?t=1720813438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Extract back to your Hideout to store the loot you've found. In The Hideout you can replenish, modify your loadout and choose what dungeon to raid next. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637020/extras/b3787a0716e935b94653e7552c740d88.webp?t=1720813438\" width=600 height=55 /></span><br>If you're interested in early <strong>PLAY-TESTING</strong> or otherwise want to support and follow the development, please join the Discord server! Discord link in the sidebar -&gt;",
